gham-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 38 of the 75 years from 1951 to 2025. In 2025, October to November came in at 41% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, the middle of the grids shows March to April at 47% of normal and April to May at 62%. Grid 21506 had its driest year in 1963, at 65% of normal.</p>"}
